# Sixty-odd fixtures are compared byte-for-byte through `include_str!` and
# `include_bytes!`, and record hashes are taken over canonical bytes. Git for
# Windows defaults to `core.autocrlf=true`, which would rewrite every one of
# them on checkout and fail tests that are correct — a failure that looks like a
# real regression and is not.
#
# Normalise to LF in the working tree on every platform. `text=auto` still
# detects and leaves binary files alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
